Cell["Diagram Networks", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cd4017eb-5610-42bf-bfdb-8e16340fab38"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Rather than arranging diagrams in a grid-like fashion, there is a more \
flexible way to wire arbitrary ports using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DiagramNetwork"]], 
    "paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/DiagramNetwork", 
    "Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3b31b408-8e8f-4f8a-9008-816aa8af447b"],
 ", which connects all equivalent ports independent of their position within \
or across all diagrams."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a044f2db-14d4-4de6-ab8a-7da508ae8a16"],

Cell["\<\
For example it is possible to create a loop by wiring input and output \
together:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"466c7288-7bbb-42b9-8639-16a3a1ad77d9"],

